[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3940250010","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116608#issuecomment-3940250010","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116608","id":3940250010,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7q23Ga","user":{"login":"Rindbee","id":30386067,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMzg2MDY3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30386067?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee","html_url":"https://github.com/Rindbee","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-22T06:00:46Z","updated_at":"2026-02-22T06:00:46Z","body":"There's no need for that, since it's a method that returns an Error, and there are corresponding error codes. \n\nI actually think `ResourceLoader::get_resource_uid()` is more problematic. In particular, the file extensions mentioned in #99540. When a return value of `-1` is received, you cannot determine whether the UID is missing or not supported.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3940250010/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3941204711","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116608#issuecomment-3941204711","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116608","id":3941204711,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7q6gLn","user":{"login":"Naros","id":3255568,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNTU1Njg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3255568?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros","html_url":"https://github.com/Naros","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-22T15:27:30Z","updated_at":"2026-02-22T15:27:30Z","body":"> There's no need for that, since it's a method that returns an Error, and there are corresponding error codes.\n\nYes, I realize the method can return `ERR_FILE_UNRECOGNIZED`, but that's not really my point.  \n\nAs I said, all other methods that are called on `ResourceFormatLoader` and `ResourceFormatSaver` are all predicated based on checking the resource or path at the engine level, with the exception of `set_uid`. If the goal is for this to operate differently from the other methods, I'm suggesting we clearly document this nuance is all if that's what the core team wants, or we agree the API should change.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3941204711/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3941894075","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116608#issuecomment-3941894075","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116608","id":3941894075,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7q9Ie7","user":{"login":"Rindbee","id":30386067,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMzg2MDY3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30386067?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee","html_url":"https://github.com/Rindbee","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-22T23:16:10Z","updated_at":"2026-02-22T23:16:10Z","body":"I took another look at the code, and the error code would be overridden by the return code of the last saver (even though it might not process the path). Therefore, there is a issue here. If the saver that handles it encounters an error during calling `set_uid()`, it may eventually return `ERR_FILE_UNRECOGNIZED`.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3941894075/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]